 "notes": "Primary source: One Piece Wiki 'Bounty/List' (page 'Bounties' redirects to 'Bounty', table lives at 'Bounty/List'), read via the MediaWiki API (last revised 2026-09-07). Second source for every entry: the character's own wiki page infobox (bounty field, in 'Template:<Name> Tabs Top' for major characters), read via the API; all 48 amounts match between the two. Wikipedia/ANN were not needed and ANN had no matching article in search. Chapters 1131-1199 were scanned via the API for new bounty reveals: only Loki (ch. 1131) and Rocks (no amount) turned up; ch. 1199 is the latest released chapter (1200 due 30 Nov 2026), ep. 1180 (aired 27 Sep 2026) is the latest episode page. Caveats: Zoro's 1,111,000,000 follows the official @Eiichiro_Staff correction to the ch. 1058 printing. The Bounty/List cites ch. 801 for Usopp's 500M (a ref slip); his infobox and the crew table correctly give ch. 1058. Gecko Moria's 320M was shown in ch. 455 but the anime (ep. 349) skipped the infobox; ep. 917 later shows it still active, so revealedEpisode is null. Capone Bege's 350M is from the ch. 966 cover page (cover story), so it has no anime episode; his 300M previous is ch. 812 / ep. 763. Bonney's ep. 1089 comes from her character page (the list leaves it blank). Dorry/Brogy/Loki episodes (1160/1161) come from their character pages. Status 'final' = dead (Roger, Whitebeard) or a bounty the wiki marks inactive/retracted (Doflamingo imprisoned, Weevil, Arlong captured). Kaidou and Big Mom are 'active' here but the wiki lists their status as 'Unknown' after Wano. Loki's 2.6B is described in-story as a 'special' World Government bounty. Teach had no bounty (0) before Moria's Hachinosu attack. Biggest jump among entries: Buggy +3,174,000,000 (15M to 3.189B); biggest multiplier among Straw Hats: Chopper x10 (100 to 1,000). Spoiler = latest bounty revealed after ch. 597 / ep. 516. Groups: Buggy listed as Emperor (also Cross Guild leader); Luffy listed as Straw Hat (also Emperor); Hawkins/Apoo as Worst Generation (Beasts Pirates members); Dorry/Brogy (Giant Warrior Pirates) and Loki under Other."
